BAFTA has awarded more than &pound;270,000 in grants to 112 emerging creatives across the UK and North America through its 2026 bursary and scholarship programmes.&nbsp;

The funding is intended to support early-career talent who are pursuing careers in film, games, and television. This year, 100 creatives will receive support through the Prince William BAFTA Bursary, a 40% increase on last year.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/bafta-awards-over-270000-to-support-112-emerging-creatives/">MORE</a>]
