Turkish mobile games developer Flow Games has secured a $46 million funding package, with approximately three-quarters of that sum coming from Tencent, according to a source familiar with the matter who spoke to PocketGamer.biz.&nbsp;

The Istanbul-based studio is behind Smash Fest, a physics-based mobile shooter that has seen significant download growth in recent months, according to AppMagic estimates. ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/exclusive-turkish-developer-flow-games-raises-46m-in-funding-package-led-by-tencent/">MORE</a>]
